{"schema_version":1,"paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","questions":[{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q01","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q01","number":"1","order":1,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8888317cfa71baca9d4a43e8b8019cd8e1ea12e4e198377a5db7fe79719db7cc","body":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 下列不属于国际单位制基本单位的是\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. g"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. s"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. K"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q02","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q02","number":"2","order":2,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4b13eae504ff75d490275f890a7463f3c2d9f477592bd53eab374d0435103c54","body":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b6a50219964a4e8c463bee6145f5e0ebca11fa72c2755454c19f6ec0178b9788.png","width":1277,"height":237,"width_mm":149.979,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第2题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 分析铅球运动的距离，可以把铅球视为质点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 分析竞技体操男子双杠运动，可以把运动员视为质点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 分析跳台跳水运动的技术动作，可以把运动员视为质点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 分析竞技体操吊环运动，可以把运动员视为质点"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q03","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q03","number":"3","order":3,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"35614e34fbacbd5abaf498ce6293af26c0ee28384ccaacd782b47915f092163e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"3. 如图所示，乒乓球从斜面滚下后，以某一速度在水平的桌面上做直线运动。在与乒乓球路径垂直的方向上放一个直径略大于乒乓球的纸筒。当乒乓球经过纸筒正前方时，用吸管对着球横向吹气。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ff34d43f9c1ab1799cb88036635efcf3a9ba3e05108d5ba167072f7a436a66b6.png","width":345,"height":236,"width_mm":40.485,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q03-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第3题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 乒乓球仍沿着直线运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 乒乓球将偏离原来的运动路径，但不进入纸筒"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 乒乓球一定能进入纸筒"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 只有用力吹气，乒乓球才能进入纸筒"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q04","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q04","number":"4","order":4,"type":"单选题","topics":["近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a2ba37a1dec1bb3d6fcc514e3a8cabefc6a4e1bf05cbf3f4c3247373560486e9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"4. 关于以下物理现象，下列说法正确的是\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 普朗克提出了光量子的概念，得出了同实验相符的黑体辐射公式"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 光电效应说明光子具有能量和动量，揭示了光的波动性"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 放射性元素衰变的快慢由核内部自身因素决定，不受温度、外界压强的影响"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 过量的射线对生物组织有破坏作用，用 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":" 射线照射过的食品不可食用"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q05","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q05","number":"5","order":5,"type":"单选题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e4f5e226c4948f4ab6fc7ce9e58423c3c96b0f44eae1ecf17e8192d14403d811","body":[{"type":"text","value":"5. 关于下列四幅图像中物理现象的描述，说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eebcb562ae500e092fe77bd5cc4157205ffa14280f6c2a1b24e23963afc46b91.png","width":223,"height":268,"width_mm":26.131,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q05-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第5题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e303d8e3ba7e416027d4da3ab89b8dcd85e4d3760eaca29b1acb5335583390ce.png","width":248,"height":278,"width_mm":29.076,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q05-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第5题图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7ca9815235a7a8bb3352467a0e0a5582ee5a36702bfccce44aea00a65f253c89.png","width":266,"height":269,"width_mm":31.1,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q05-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第5题图丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/de7389d5038a4d970472f6dc2858c2e737f3fb854a5dfef7ac0e6345a95f9a65.png","width":281,"height":266,"width_mm":32.94,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q05-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第5题图丁\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 图甲为“饮水小鸭”玩具，小鸭虽能不断饮水，但不违背能量守恒定律"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 图乙为空气压缩引火仪，硝化棉被点燃，是因为活塞与容器壁摩擦产生了热量"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 图丙为红墨水在清水中的扩散现象，扩散的快慢与温度无关"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 图丁为一台冰箱，给冰箱供电后，热量自发地从冰箱内部传到了外部"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q06","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q06","number":"6","order":6,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3fc9e4c31731d5ce7d3aff88c224d5893acab695a9a2a925ac1a88344d9fc2b1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"6. 如图所示，为高中物理实验室常用的磁电式电流表的内部结构，基本组成部分是磁体和放在磁体两极之间的线圈，其物理原理就是通电线圈因受安培力而转动。电流表的两磁极装有极靴，极靴中间还有一个用软铁制成的圆柱。关于磁电式电流表，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8625da556c944795ae5b9239c41e15d7a87c11dac2573b689b1a41b64b45371c.png","width":344,"height":296,"width_mm":40.301,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q06-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第6题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A．铁质圆柱内部磁感应强度为零"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B．线圈的磁通量始终为零"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C．线圈转动时，螺旋弹簧变形，反抗线圈转动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D．电流不为零，线圈停止转动后不再受到安培力"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q07","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q07","number":"7","order":7,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"08841fe5c7f47c5eaf7ecf385d01febb0281b0fd427f17a29356c81de57e2045","body":[{"type":"text","value":"7. 科学晚会上，一位老师表演了一个“魔术”。魔术道具如图甲所示，手摇起电机旁有一个没有底的空塑料瓶，起电机两根放电杆分别与瓶内的锯条、金属片相连。瓶内俯视图如图乙所示。瓶内放一盘点燃的蚊香，很快就看见整个塑料瓶内烟雾缭绕。转动手摇起电机手柄，瓶内烟雾很快消失；停止转动手柄，瓶内又恢复烟雾缭绕的状态。起电机工作时，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6fd95161153c97d7e163e39d35ca50d3dd41b8dadb4105d2d83f821260fcc09e.png","width":536,"height":291,"width_mm":62.936,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q07-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第7题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/76bb621d215050fbd8326733de6e74e4c15a0dd32ca4ff164b1ccc65f027cf19.png","width":361,"height":253,"width_mm":42.325,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q07-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n瓶内俯视图\n第 7 题图乙\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 烟尘颗粒在向某极运动过程中做匀加速运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 金属片与锯条间的场强方向由锯条指向金属片"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 烟尘颗粒因被电离而吸附在金属片上"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 烟尘颗粒运动过程中电势能减小"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q08","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3c1cf22146eb687f77e5e872bef402b0b2f08b3fd057c749bf1c06acfb248747","body":[{"type":"text","value":"8. 如图为科幻电影中的太空电梯示意图。超级缆绳将地球赤道上的固定基地、同步空间站和配重空间站连接在一起，它们随地球同步旋转，P 为太空电梯。地球同步卫星的轨道在同步空间站和配重空间站之间。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ad02bf15de86e975c4138c276523642515bec11cc63bd7bcdc0c96923cf1525a.png","width":491,"height":236,"width_mm":57.609,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q08-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第8题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 若太空电梯沿缆绳匀速运动，则其内的物体受力平衡"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 宇航员可以自由漂浮在配重空间站内"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 从太空电梯向外自由释放一物块，物块将相对电梯做加速直线运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若两空间站之间缆绳断裂，配重空间站将做离心运动"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q09","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0b3857241e3b4d3271aa8ac261c9585f5a091c47239827cf34400e9290b1a62c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"9. 游乐园内喷泉喷出的水柱使得质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 的卡通玩具悬停在空中（假设这样冲水，能保持短暂平衡）。为估算，作如下假定后进行理论分析：假设喷泉水柱从横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 的喷口以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 持续竖直向上喷出；玩具底部为平板（面积大于 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" ）；水柱冲击到玩具底部后，竖直方向的速度变为零，朝四周均匀散开。已知水的密度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":" ，当地重力加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" ，空气阻力忽略不计。下列说法错误的是\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 水柱对玩具底部的作用力大小等于玩具重力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 水柱对玩具底部的作用力与玩具重力是一对平衡力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 喷泉单位时间内喷出的水质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho v_{0} S"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 玩具在空中悬停时，其底部相对于喷口的高度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{g} - \\frac{M^{2} g}{\\rho^{2} v_{0}^{2} S^{2}}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q10","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4f6601ff120543a4695ec6d3d9d6ac6f981f7a03df56d9f51927586c59241737","body":[{"type":"text","value":"10. 如图甲所示，为杭州亚运吉祥物琮琮演示的攀岩运动。当琮琮处于平衡状态，且岩钉 A 位置固定时，分析问题可以将该实际情境进行简化处理，得到如图乙所示模型。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3a07765fcb04e8b86b7354e1a29e9afcd623f7a41b25f0aa97ad4d5059abdc81.png","width":298,"height":260,"width_mm":34.964,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第10题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/62b49a552996dec02ef50dfffe33e66ab87075ebd77e01a9d14a5addff1cb91c.png","width":210,"height":260,"width_mm":24.659,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 10 题图乙\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 仅缩短主绳长度，绳子对琮琮的拉力不变"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 仅缩短主绳长度，岩壁对琮琮的作用力的大小不变"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 仅增加主绳长度，绳子对琮琮的拉力减小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 仅增加主绳长度，岩壁对琮琮的作用力增大"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q11","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7fa5bbd2915a0d0ee91603a886fde29c4e33077e4b2c00991f7c4a8ae06f0527","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11. 如图所示，滑块以初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 从 O 点沿斜面向上运动，同时小球以初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 从 O 点斜向上抛出，滑块向上运动时和小球在斜面上的 P 点正好相遇。已知滑块和小球质量相等且均可视为质点，空气阻力忽略不计。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8e13a1b9083d12fb43b9ba1705ae298903ec5ba21c018f271b8be86d4bb9d1c1.png","width":330,"height":212,"width_mm":38.738,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第11题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 斜面可能是光滑的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 小球运动到最高点时离斜面最远"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 在 P 点时，小球的动能大于滑块的动能"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 小球和滑块到达 P 点过程中克服重力做功的平均功率不相等"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q12","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianme