,"value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 为圆心，作两个相同的扇形，不考虑扇形以外远处离子的作用。所有离子均可看成质点，且它们之间的相互作用遵从“平方反比”规律。已知相邻两个离子之间的引力大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7e59386b8d993b482dfd4951d0261be1b36e0ea09d470e507e6125c03168d3ec.png","width":466,"height":289,"width_mm":54.718,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 13 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 所受扇形范围内的正负离子对它的合力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(\\sqrt{2} + 1\\right) F"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 所受扇形范围内的正负离子对它的合力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(\\sqrt{2} - \\frac{1}{2}\\right) F"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 所受扇形范围内的正负离子对它的合力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(\\sqrt{2} - 1\\right) F"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 所受扇形范围内的正负离子对它的合力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left(1 + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right) F"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学","力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7fdaa893f762a43bd1690a3e9caeff08471ffc7ec7ed5c375af070a40b973ea4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 关于下列四幅图像中物理现象的描述，说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/de52bf9e40c27a4bb4edc3c07c9b221c1b30ad06f139045b40a85c916ef733a7.png","width":298,"height":216,"width_mm":34.964,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14 题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cad3f1feb5b044446f752c3eaf86496a55adab4073aafffbe0eddad3419fe330.png","width":360,"height":229,"width_mm":42.325,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingx