value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的起振方向相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 波在介质 I 中的周期比在介质 II 中小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 波在介质 I 中的波长可能为 5m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 波在介质 II 中的波长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{20}{2n+1}m(n=1,2,3,\\cdots)"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"983fbbd59f7a727b237da16dc5b2d4d98b09feb5be0f68bb2d9ce00d59bff9db","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. 实验题（I、II、III 题共 14 分）\nI. 某同学用如图甲所示的装置，通过小铁球竖直方向上的运动来验证动量定理。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/09359351b031b358d54f89099e0057ddd0736244405ec636b8d6ece9398706a6.png","width":279,"height":388,"width_mm":32.756,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-I 题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d7b994e7bbece5e85285a7ca654675da9390c520a8142f6a5fcb9aed13766c00.png","width":573,"height":384,"width_mm":67.168,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-I 题图乙\n实验步骤如下:\na. 如图甲所示，用电磁铁吸住小铁球，将光电门 A、B 分别固定在立柱上，调整位置使小铁球、光电门 A、光电门 B 在同一竖直线上；\nb. 切断电磁铁电源，小铁球自由下落。数字计时器测出小铁球通过光电门 A、B 所用的时间分别 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小铁球从光电门 A 运动到光电门 B 的时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）用游标卡尺测量钢球的直径，如图乙所示，可读出钢球直径 "},{"type":"math","value":"d="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{mm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（2）若要验证动量定理，本实验还需获得的物理量为（填空）（用文字和字母表示）。本实验需要验证的物理量关系为（填空）（用题中给出的字母表示）。\n（3）根据实验测定的小铁球重力冲量 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 及其动量变化量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta p"},{"type":"text","value":" 绘制的下列图像，图中虚线代表理论图线，实线代表实际测量图线。若考虑实验中空气阻力的影响，可能正确的是 （填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2097c3279efab5c56db8d73e8cbfc49abf6041f32bd5584db9e8c644e1e17b44.png","width":846,"height":221,"width_mm":99.483,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA、B 选项图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7a17196f90a194b018888b86c91c88d100a36e3dc53a584ff41728ab9d8294c7.png","width":870,"height":247,"width_mm":102.306,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC、D 选项图\nII. 某实验小组的同学在实验室练习多用电表的使用。\n（1）使用多用电表不同挡位进行测量时，下列接法正确的有 （填空） （多选）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c3c6ec450ca39620806a5a6615efcdc45c3c729fd95899065bb8ab3fe697eb49.png","width":1242,"height":407,"width_mm":146.05,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲、乙、丙、丁\nA. 如图甲所示，用直流电压挡测量小灯泡两端的电压  \nB. 如图乙所示，用直流电流挡测量电路中的电流  \nC. 如图丙所示，用欧姆挡测量小灯泡的工作电阻  \nD. 如图丁所示，用欧姆挡测量二极管的反向电阻\n（2）老师告诉同学们：“我们可以根据多用电表的表头，判断旋钮在欧姆挡不同倍率时，欧姆表的内阻。”欧姆挡的电路原理如图戊所示，实验室某个欧姆表的表头照片如图己所示。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7470ee498399ead929925bb87027a3f8f896cc120c94f2210f8ae8e26ea6e304.png","width":338,"height":337,"width_mm":39.565,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n戊\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2857fcdbb0d6812482998f296bfabdaaf44c5e3b12957524b581dac003a5f7d1.png","width":488,"height":257,"width_mm":57.231,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n己\n①当旋钮在×10倍率时，正确调零后，欧姆表的内阻为（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n②若某个多用电表内的电学元件 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" （如图戊所示）损坏，换成最大阻值比 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 略大的 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，（填空）（选填“需要”或“不需要”）更换该多用电表的表头。\n（3）使用多用电表探索某个黑箱内的电学元件。如图庚所示，该黑箱有3个接线柱。已知该黑箱内的元件不超过2个，每两个接线柱之间最多只能接1个元件，且元件种类仅限于定值电阻、干电池和二极管。实验操作如下：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/26fbad91350751dac196ea45c541765dc9e5fc0c04c930366208486e4701870a.png","width":256,"height":167,"width_mm":29.996,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\n庚\n①进行 （填空）（选填“机械调零”或“欧姆调零”）后，使用直流电压 2.5V 挡依次接 A 和 B、B 和 C、A 和 C，示数均为零。\n②将选择开关旋到欧姆挡，正确调零后，连接情况和所得数据如下表所示。\n"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"math","value":"\\quad"},{"type":"text","value":"黑表笔接"}],[{"type":"text","value":"A"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"A"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C"}]],[[{"type":"math","value":"\\quad"},{"type":"text","value":"红表笔接"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"A"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C"}],[{"type":"text","value":"A"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B"}]],[[{"type":"math","value":"\\quad"},{"type":"text","value":"测得的电阻/"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"}],[{"type":"text","value":"20"}],[{"type":"text","value":"20"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\infty"}],[{"type":"text","value":"35"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\infty"}],[{"type":"text","value":"15"}]]]},{"type":"text","value":"\n③根据步骤①、②得到的结果，将黑箱的内部结构画在答题纸相应位置。若有干电池，标出电压；若有定值电阻，标出阻值；若有二极管，标出二极管正向电阻。\nIII. 关于“用双缝干涉测量光的波长”、“测量玻璃折射率”两个实验，下列说法正确的有\n（填空） （多选）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1877d441ed9de2c78874e272c5992595b930d2caac6687479c3dfd2eebde040c.png","width":812,"height":180,"width_mm":95.324,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row7"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16-III题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/85bbb098877234e332b05f3fcbaa10cac6af0f3185b4a67ff6c05d00d697b977.png","width":178,"height":165,"width_mm":20.795,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row7"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-III 题图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ea826f58959ab4b59ad72487c05df193d2acaac8bbb6f4722140c9b2b13f1141.png","width":936,"height":355,"width_mm":110.067,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q16-row8"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16-III 题图丙、第 16-III 题图丁\nA. 如图甲所示，为光具座放置的光学元件，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 为双缝  \nB. 如图乙所示，波长的测量值大于真实值  \nC. 如图丙所示， "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 及 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间的距离适当大些，可以减小实验误差  \nD. 如图丁所示，将玻璃砖两界面画得比实际宽，则测得的折射率比真实值大"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. 实验题（共 14 分）\nI.\n(1) 6.5 (1 分)\n（2）当地重力加速度g （1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"gt=\\frac{d}{t_{B}}-\\frac{d}{t_{A}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3) B (1 分)\nII.\n(1) BD (2 分)\n(2) ①100（1 分） ②不需要（1 分）\n(3) ①机械调零 (1 分)\n③电路图（1分）、电阻阻值（1分）、二极管正向电阻（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1ec050d6fe51d18b3eb79df6e8aefc561233e8a8627638c0d0faeb7a654f01d9.png","width":264,"height":169,"width_mm":33.5},{"type":"text","value":"III. BC (2 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7e4ef629bdc6e02493797406e8738a5816e4d47a23c6d091c71567e980ea902f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（8分）如图所示，导热性能良好的金属圆柱形气缸质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.5\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，气缸内封闭有长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l_{0} = 1m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的空气，气缸与水平面的动摩擦系数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.4"},{"type":"text","value":" ，截面为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" 字形的活塞与竖直墙面接触且无挤压力，活塞底面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"s = 1\\times 10^{-3}m^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。忽略活塞与气缸间的摩擦，活塞质量很小可忽略，设环境温度稳定，大气压强恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_0 = 1.0\\times 10^5Pa"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现用水平外力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 使气缸缓慢向右运动，运动位移大小记为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）在此过程中器壁单位面积所受气体分子的平均作用力 （填空） （选填“变大”“变小”或“不变”），气体 （填空） （选填“吸热”或“放热”）；\n(2) 当 x=0.6m 时，求封闭空气的压强；\n（3）当 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0.6\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，测得外力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 做功约为33.2J，求此过程中气体与外界交换的热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/68fca876b8ef654e22c42f08f21f9cf3b322f1562ca4af4e5335e355fd2a0ffa.png","width":621,"height":127,"width_mm":72.873,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (8 分)\n(1) 变大 (1 分) 放热 (1 分)\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}l_{0}s=p(l_{0}-x)s"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"p = 2.5 \\times 10^{5} \\, Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"p_0sx + W_F = W + \\mu mgx"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）解得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = -92J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"57676972a2057048cc547088806715579e05418ec1f7743c976a2ada4f65d826","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（11分）如图所示，质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}=0.1kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小物块P从静止开始沿斜面AB和水平面BC运动到C点，与C点处质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}=0.3kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小物块Q发生碰撞，碰撞后，小物块Q从C点飞出，运动到水平地面上的D点。斜面AB与水平面之间的夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" ，且 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan\\theta=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，斜面AB与水平面BC平滑连接，动摩擦系数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":" 均为0.2，水平面BC的长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{BC}=0.3m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，C点距离水平地面的高度H=0.6m。（不计空气阻力，取重力加速度g为 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）。\n（1）若小物块 Q 从 C 点运动到 D 点的水平距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{CD} = 0.6 \\, m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求小物块 Q 从 C 点抛出的初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{c}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小；\n（2）若小物块 P 从 h=1.7m 处下滑，且最终 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{CD}=0.6\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，计算并回答：小物块 P、Q 发生的是否为弹性碰撞？\n（3）若小物块P、Q发生的是弹性碰撞，当释放高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h"},{"type":"text","value":" 满足什么条件时，小物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 能从 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 点飞出，而小物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 不会从 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 点飞出？\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/57a715f62c6a2ebebe7e47b59f9d0215ceed5528577c67e02aa64a6c7f9afdb2.png","width":646,"height":340,"width_mm":75.896,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（11分）\n(1) (3 分)\n在 y 方向上:"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{1}{2}gt^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n在 x 方向上:"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{CD} = v_{c}t"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{c}} = \\sqrt{3} m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2) (4 分)\n由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}g(h - H) - \\left(\\frac{\\mu m_{1}g(h - H)}{\\tan\\theta} +\\mu m_{1}gx_{\\mathrm{BC}}\\right) = \\frac{1}{2} m_{1}v_{0}^{2} - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = 2\\sqrt{3} m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"设碰撞后小物块P和Q的速度大小分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。由动量守恒定理："},{"type":"math","value":"m_1v_0 + 0 = m_1v_1 + m_2v_2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）由动能守恒定理："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{