，假设成立，最终停在距离原点"},{"type":"math","value":"3.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"处。\n(3) (5 分)\n0 到"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"过程:"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1} = BIL = \\frac{B^{2}L^{2}v}{R} = 0.9\\,\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{1} = F x_{1} = 3.24\\,\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"过程:\n设"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{0}=1.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"，由三角形相似："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{x_{2}-x}{x_{2}-x_{1}}=\\frac{L}{L_{0}}"},{"type":"math","value":"L=(6.6-1.5x)\\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":"回路中电阻："},{"type":"math","value":"R = \\left(\\frac{5}{3} L + L\\right)\\lambda = \\frac{8}{3} L\\Omega"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{2} = BIL = \\frac{B^{2}L^{2}v}{R} = \\frac{3}{4}(6.6 - 1.5x)\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n作 F-x 图像，并由均匀变化力做功大小等于直线于 x 轴围成三角形的面积可得："},{"type":"math","value":"W_{2}=0.36J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n全过程中："},{"type":"math","value":"Q = W_{1} + W_{2} = 3.6J"},{"type":"text","value":"直导体棒："},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1}=\\frac{R_{1}}{R_{1}+R_{2}}Q=1.35J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c058b0ff0f28cfe206c4c7cb5efa735b681ea203ffbee97875d49010576eb415","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（11分）磁控管是微波炉的核心器件，磁控管中心为热电子发射源，电子在电场和磁场的共同作用下，形成了如图甲所示的漂亮形状。现将该磁控管简化成如图乙所示的装置，两足够长的平行金属板相距 "},{"type":"math","value":"4d"},{"type":"text","value":" ，板间中心有一电子发射源 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 向各个方向发射初速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电子。已知电子比荷为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{e}{m} (\\frac{e}{m} >0)"},{"type":"text","value":" ，仅考虑纸平面内运动的电子，回答以下问题：\n（1）若两板间不加磁场，仅接一电压恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电源，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"U = \\frac{4mv_0^2}{\\mathrm{e}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求：\n①电子在板间运动的加速度的大小；\n②电子打到金属板的最长时间和最短时间之差。\n（2）若两板间不接电源，仅加垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场B，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{mv_{0}}{2ed}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求：\n①有电子打到的金属板总长度；\n②打在金属板上的电子占发射电子总数的百分比。\n（3）在两金属板之间接一电压恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电源的同时，加一垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"U = \\frac{4mv_0^2}{\\mathrm{e}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"B = \\frac{mv_0}{\\mathrm{ed}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。考虑初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf{v}_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 水平向右的电子，求该电子打在金属板上时速度的大小和方向。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c1529448bc5c9ac7651fa66a11b740a045cfb5b060e44fbea9bfdc22e214e9a4.png","width":436,"height":410,"width_mm":51.158,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第20题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e6eaf12cc4d0ea327d5b4719d9439b83946e346207822fc396e7aa0411d983d8.png","width":536,"height":436,"width_mm":62.936,"row_group":"gaosan-z20-mingxiao-lianmeng-2408-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第20题图乙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（11分）\n(1) (4 分)\n①"},{"type":"math","value":"eE=ma"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{U}{4d}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{d}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n②水平向左运动的电子运动距离"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{2a}=\\frac{d}{2}<2d"},{"type":"text","value":"该电子不会打在左侧金属板上（1分）\n电子打到金属板的最长时间和最短时间之差"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t=\\frac{2v_{0}}{a}=\\frac{2d}{v_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2) (4 分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c8833acce161b12727f472b2cf9d99b41529ec79a6911db0d22daf11435a8849.png","width":359,"he