到金属板上时，圆周运动的速度的两个分量分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"，如图戊所示"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}^{2}+v_{y}^{2}=v_{1}^{2}+v_{0}^{2}\\quad v_{x}^{2}+(v_{y}+v_{1})^{2}=v^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}=v_{y}=v_{0}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{v_{1}+v_{y}}{v_{x}}=2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n综上，电子打在金属板上时速度的大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\sqrt{5}v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向与水平向右方向夹角"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=\\arctan2"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/60669224385bb895ca69dfaf524c9c3453ce9a7a04a264a9c9a449dc87357ec9.png","width":182,"height":136,"width_mm":23},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2b52d8ec2af41fa493f2c0332ad5f97c6eebafb1c5bdcd3d0192782fe2118910.png","width":233,"height":169,"width_mm":29.4},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e79bac21dcfc351cc25ccd56b8354241b68f96aead5f9f09c12434807db75e01.png","width":205,"height":228,"width_mm":25.9}]}}]}
